@abstract:
Physical State contract for PanLL — panel-based layout and lifecycle
framework built with ReScript. Uses TEA architecture with SafeDOM
enforcement via Nickel contracts.
@end

@requires:
- section: Core-Files
- section: Source-Quality
- section: Banned
@end

## Core-Files

### license-present
- description: LICENSE file must exist
- run: test -f LICENSE
- severity: critical

### readme-present
- description: README must exist
- run: test -f README.adoc || test -f README.md
- severity: critical

### rescript-config
- description: rescript.json must exist
- run: test -f rescript.json
- severity: critical

### app-entry
- description: App.res entry point must exist
- run: test -f src/App.res
- severity: critical

### model-entry
- description: Model.res must exist
- run: test -f src/Model.res
- severity: critical

### safedom-enforcement
- description: SafeDOM Nickel enforcement config must exist
- run: test -f contractiles/safedom-enforcement.ncl
- severity: critical

## Source-Quality

### no-deprecated-js-apis
- description: No deprecated Js.* APIs
- run: grep -rn 'Js\.\(Dict\|Array2\|String2\)' src/ --include='*.res' | wc -l | grep -q '^0$'
- severity: critical

### spdx-headers
- description: ReScript source files should have SPDX headers
- run: find src/ -name '*.res' | head -20 | xargs -r grep -L 'SPDX-License-Identifier' | wc -l | grep -q '^0$'
- severity: warning

### panels-not-panes
- description: Code must use "panels" terminology, never "panes"
- run: grep -rni 'pane[^l]' src/ --include='*.res' | grep -iv 'panel' | wc -l | grep -q '^0$'
- severity: critical

## Banned

### no-dockerfile
- description: No Dockerfiles
- run: test ! -f Dockerfile
- severity: critical

### no-makefile
- description: No Makefiles
- run: test ! -f Makefile
- severity: critical

### no-env-files
- description: No .env files committed
- run: test ! -f .env
- severity: critical
